<header class="editorial-hero">
  <h1>About OnlinePDFPro</h1>
  <p class="editorial-meta">Fast, private browser PDF utilities and 100% free written study materials for college studies — with no sign-in or paywalls.</p>
</header>

<div class="editorial-grid">
  <section class="editorial-card">
    <h2>What We Do</h2>
    <p>OnlinePDFPro is an all-in-one web platform built for students, educators, and professionals who need reliable PDF and document tools alongside free college study materials. Everything works directly in your browser without installing bulky software or creating an account.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="editorial-card">
    <h2>{{ toolRegistry.tools | length }} Free Browser PDF &amp; Document Tools</h2>
    <p>Our toolkit covers everyday document workflows including merging, splitting, compressing, editing text, signing, converting between PDF, Word, and images, and extracting text with OCR. Core PDF utilities run locally inside your browser so your documents stay private on your device.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="editorial-card">
    <h2>Free Study Materials for College Studies</h2>
    <p>Alongside our document tools, we publish structured, exam-focused chapter-wise PDF study guides for computer science and college coursework — starting with our Database Management Systems (DBMS) textbook series. You can read every chapter directly inside the site or download the PDFs for offline revision completely free.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="editorial-card">
    <h2>Contact &amp; Feedback</h2>
    <p>OnlinePDFPro is independently maintained with a focus on speed, clarity, and student accessibility. Have a question, bug report, or study material suggestion? Reach out anytime at <a href="mailto:support@onlinepdfpro.com">support@onlinepdfpro.com</a>.</p>
  </section>
